{"id":"T01-settings-ack","base":"41fd6c3923d47ec4d3d84d8c35b610a879ee93ab","message":"修复（会话设置）：返回已提交快照并允许忙碌时保存下一轮 Provider\n\n通过与轮次相同的有序队列提交设置，持久化后返回本次接受的快照；空更新也能确认当前设置，避免依赖去重后可能缺失的通知。\n按线程串行验证与提交，通知使用捕获快照而非后续实时配置；保留 Plan 模式并替换其旧模型设置。\n新增无操作确认和运行中 Provider 选择的集成测试，重新生成稳定/实验协议及 Python 类型。实际验证命令和结果见优化工作台构建记录；未运行完整工作区或真实 Provider 调用。","prepare":[["just","write-app-server-schema"],["just","write-app-server-schema","--experimental"]],"tests":[["just","test","-p","codex-app-server-protocol"],["just","test","-p","codex-app-server","-E","test(model_provider_setup) | test(thread_settings_update)"],["just","test","-p","codex-core","-E","test(provider_switch) | test(settings_commits)"]],"lint_packages":["codex-app-server","codex-core","codex-app-server-protocol","codex-protocol"],"generated_paths":["codex-rs/app-server-protocol/schema","sdk/python/src/openai_codex/generated"],"patch_encoding":"gzip-base64","patch_sha256":"3332b69a309e1286fdc149d406f7e9478d205bfd8dcd334010aa22222e050805","patch":""}